1. SCOPE

These terms govern the use of the binary distribution of the Talkdedsec code editor (the
"Software"). By installing or using the Software you accept them.

The Software is NOT OPEN SOURCE. Its source code is not published, and this document grants
you no rights to the source code.

2. USE

You may install and use the Software free of charge, on any number of machines. No distinction
is made between personal and organisational, or commercial and non-commercial use.

3. RESTRICTIONS

You may not:

a) Redistribute, sell, rent, sublicense or offer the Software under your own name.
b) Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software, except to the extent applicable
   law overrides this restriction.
c) Disable or circumvent any integrity checking or copy protection mechanism.
d) Remove or alter any copyright notice, trademark or this document.
e) Create and distribute a derivative product based on the Software.

4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Software includes third-party open-source components distributed under their own licenses.
Their copyright notices and license texts are included with the Software and listed in the
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES file. For those components, the terms of the applicable open-source license
take precedence over this document.

5. DATA AND PRIVACY

The Software collects no telemetry and contacts no server at startup. It works fully offline.
There is no update server.

If you choose to use the AI agent embedded in the Software, those requests go to the relevant
provider through your own account and are governed by that provider's privacy policy. This is
an action you initiate.

6. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTY

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING
BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND
NONINFRINGEMENT.

7. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY

TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR
ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE USE OF OR
INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE.

8. TERMINATION

The rights granted to you terminate automatically if you breach these terms. Upon termination
you must delete all copies of the Software.

9. GOVERNING LAW

This document is governed by the laws of the Republic of Türkiye.

